  "body": "Designed with family living in mind, this sunny three-bedroom home is a great fit for those wanting a comfortable space and low maintenance. The sunny north-facing aspect is a real highlight, with a spacious private balcony providing the perfect spot for family meals or entertaining. A second outdoor living area overlooking Mount Taylor Reserve adds another dimension, giving families a choice of spaces and a peaceful connection with the outdoors. \r\nRenovated in 2016, the home is finished with a combination of Nu-Wall and cedar cladding, giving it a smart contemporary appearance. Additionally, the property is fully fenced with access via an electric car gate, internal access garaging and framed with landscaped gardens. This home has been thoughtfully updated for modern living.\r\nIdeally positioned and in zone for Glendowie School and Glendowie College, with Sacred Heart College also within walking distance. Easy access to nearby St Heliers village and beach for shopping and enjoying the waterfront.  Local shops, parks, sports clubs and the Tamaki Estuary are just a few minutes away in this family focused neighbourhood. \r\nCombining secure outdoor spaces, low maintenance, easy living and access to excellent local schooling, this is a well-rounded Glendowie home for families looking for comfort and convenience.\r\nTo be sold by Auction 10am, Wed 18 Nov 2026 at 303 Remuera Road, Remuera",
